# SPA fallback: serve index.html for any path the static host has no file for,
# with status 200 (a 301/302 would rewrite the address bar and destroy the very
# path the router needs to read). Real files are matched first, so hashed JS/CSS
# assets are unaffected — this only catches what would otherwise 404.
#
# Belt-and-braces alongside the `routes:` rewrite in render.yaml: that block is
# applied when the service is created, so an existing service can end up without
# it. Harmlessly ignored by hosts that don't read this file.
/*    /index.html   200
